# Store text files with LF line endings so they work on the Linux server.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.glb binary
*.exr binary
# (the 3D view's estate data: offsets into them must never shift with a line ending)
*.bin binary

# the desktop app, served by /download: never touched by line endings
*.exe binary
